## Forecasts and reports

- [Wind and weather forecasts](https://www.windfinder.com/forecast/san_francisco): Forecasts for any of 200,000+ spots worldwide. URL pattern: `/forecast/{spot_name}`
- [Superforecast](https://www.windfinder.com/weatherforecast/san_francisco): Higher-resolution forecasts for Europe, North America, Egypt, Canary Islands, South Africa. URL pattern: `/weatherforecast/{spot_name}`
- [Weather reports (live)](https://www.windfinder.com/report/san_francisco): Real-time observations from nearby weather stations. URL pattern: `/report/{spot_name}`
- [Wind and weather statistics](https://www.windfinder.com/windstatistics/san_francisco): Historical wind roses, temperature averages, and seasonal patterns. URL pattern: `/windstatistics/{spot_name}`
- [Wind and weather map](https://www.windfinder.com/): Animated map showing wind speed, direction, temperature, and precipitation worldwide

## Locations

- [Top spots worldwide](https://www.windfinder.com/locations): Browse popular locations by country, region, or activity (kitesurfing, windsurfing, sailing, surfing, paragliding)

## Tools and reference

- [Wind speed calculator and conversion tables](https://www.windfinder.com/wind/windspeed): Convert between knots, beaufort, m/s, km/h, and mph. Includes beaufort scale descriptions and wind direction reference.
